  "remainingAcceptance": [
    "Installed graphical Save dialog, interactive downloads and OS integration have not been exercised; display-free real-FD and raw callback fixtures establish their stated scope.",
    "Destination filesystems without O_TMPFILE support fail explicitly. Existing files are never overwritten. Non-Linux download authority, picking/import and embedded viewers remain separate work.",
    "An already-entered kernel effect cannot be atomically revoked. A file published before late scope/namespace failure is preserved and may remain despite the reported error; no unsafe pathname rollback is attempted.",
    "Remaining platform/backend/provider/profile/release/cutover and G0-G5 gates remain open. Hosted voice remains deferred by user decision.",
    "Issues#202/#208/#214/#215/#217 remain open for complete acceptance."
  ],
